seq":null,"text":"鱼头说过，我就是归山一族，最强炼器师！","hasText":true,"duration":9.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0679468D8F7031000183439303230313036.mp3"},{"id":"0621568D8F7051000183134333431323432","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"移动喊话2（方言版）","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"（方言版）锻造百器，不过是基本功。","hasText":true,"duration":2.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0621568D8F7051000183134333431323432.mp3"},{"id":"0642668D8F7041000183137333931303635","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"移动喊话1（方言版）","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"（方言版）老话说“身小难举器，躯高可破天”，我可不信。","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0642668D8F7041000183137333931303635.mp3"},{"id":"0651468D8F7031000183436323932363333","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"大厅喊话2（方言版）","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"（方言版）有什么好怕的，我定会铸造出，这世间最强五兵！","hasText":true,"duration":8.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0651468D8F7031000183436323932363333.mp3"},{"id":"0636368D8F7041000183532393336313530","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"移动喊话1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"老话说“身小难举器，躯高可破天”，我可不信。","hasText":true,"duration":6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0636368D8F7041000183532393336313530.mp3"},{"id":"0678968D8F7021000183337353035393835","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"大厅喊话1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"世上无人成功之事，我蚩奼，偏要试试！","hasText":true,"duration":9.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0678968D8F7021000183337353035393835.mp3"},{"id":"0622468D8F7031000183931393230353432","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"大厅喊话1（方言版）","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"（方言版）世上无人成功之事，我蚩奼，偏要试试！","hasText":true,"duration":9.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0622468D8F7031000183931393230353432.mp3"},{"id":"0691868D8F7031000183733393630333932","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"大厅喊话2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"有什么好怕的，我定会铸造出，这世间最强五兵！","hasText":true,"duration":8.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0691868D8F7031000183733393630333932.mp3"},{"id":"0651168D8ECB01000183136363232323231","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"主题音乐2","category":"背景音乐","seq":null,"text":"主题音乐2","hasText":true,"duration":190.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0651168D8ECB01000183136363232323231.mp3"},{"id":"0603268D8EC931000183131353436363830","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1650","skinName":"五兵之主","title":"主题音乐1","category":"背景音乐","seq":null,"text":"主题音乐1","hasText":true,"duration":181.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/0603268D8EC931000183131353436363830.mp3"},{"id":"069816AD1EADC1000183131393234353334","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·百里守约·友","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"大家也算远亲，以后就由我来罩着你吧！","hasText":true,"duration":4.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/069816AD1EADC1000183131393234353334.mp3"},{"id":"065556AD1EADD1000183134343039313630","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·张飞·友","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"嘘——快上来！这儿有只会飞的小零食！","hasText":true,"duration":5.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/065556AD1EADD1000183134343039313630.mp3"},{"id":"061196AD1EADD1000183130313333363934","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·老夫子·友","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"那都是多久之前的事儿了！现在他们可非要跟着我，甩都甩不掉~","hasText":true,"duration":6.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/061196AD1EADD1000183130313333363934.mp3"},{"id":"063446AD1EADA1000183132353132303832","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"3技能（大招）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"让你见识下，真正的森林法则！","hasText":true,"duration":3.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/063446AD1EADA1000183132353132303832.mp3"},{"id":"061406AD1EADC1000183131343030303832","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·张飞·敌","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"哇，我从没见过像你这么胖的猞猁——","hasText":true,"duration":4.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/061406AD1EADC1000183131343030303832.mp3"},{"id":"062566AD1EADA1000183537373932373039","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·百里守约·敌","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"凭什么他们叫你“雪山之王”，却叫我“山猫”？","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/062566AD1EADA1000183537373932373039.mp3"},{"id":"069936AD1EADB1000183733383432383633","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"相遇·老夫子·敌","category":"相遇","seq":null,"text":"夫子，你家的小藏狐怎么老是这么严肃呀？","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/069936AD1EADB1000183733383432383633.mp3"},{"id":"065596AD1EADA1000183132323035303230","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"挑衅语音","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"再挠两下我真睡着了……等等，你是在攻击？","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/065596AD1EADA1000183132323035303230.mp3"},{"id":"063546AD1EAD91000183732313937393438","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"2技能-戟（中）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"不准跑！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/063546AD1EAD91000183732313937393438.mp3"},{"id":"066216AD1EAD91000183130303436393436","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"2技能-弓（远）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"封喉！","hasText":true,"duration":1.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/066216AD1EAD91000183130303436393436.mp3"},{"id":"065376AD1EAD71000183134393130313737","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"脚步放轻，接近猎物，然后……一击必杀！","hasText":true,"duration":8.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/065376AD1EAD71000183134393130313737.mp3"},{"id":"062736AD1EAD81000183439393437323833","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"1技能-殳（近）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"跳扑——","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/062736AD1EAD81000183439393437323833.mp3"},{"id":"062466AD1EAD71000183837393033363737","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"踏雪无痕的诀窍？脚掌得像我这么大才行！","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/062466AD1EAD71000183837393033363737.mp3"},{"id":"060436AD1EAD81000183731383735383439","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"1技能-戈（中）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"满分！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/060436AD1EAD81000183731383735383439.mp3"},{"id":"067726AD1EAD71000183731383630313435","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音8","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"就算是最厉害的猎手，也拒绝不了一块晒得滚烫的石头……","hasText":true,"duration":6.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/067726AD1EAD71000183731383630313435.mp3"},{"id":"064676AD1EAD91000183337303636333332","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"2技能-矛（近）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"突袭！","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/064676AD1EAD91000183337303636333332.mp3"},{"id":"066306AD1EAD81000183132393438353732","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"复活语音","category":"复活","seq":null,"text":"泉水润泽万物，生灵回以守护——这就是山野间，最古老的约定","hasText":true,"duration":8.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/066306AD1EAD81000183132393438353732.mp3"},{"id":"062366AD1EAD81000183131333131383638","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"1技能-弓（远）","category":"技能","seq":null,"text":"出击！","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/062366AD1EAD81000183131333131383638.mp3"},{"id":"061256AD1EAD61000183134383335353837","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"以前身后只有雾，现在多了一串小尾巴，感觉倒也不赖……","hasText":true,"duration":6.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/061256AD1EAD61000183134383335353837.mp3"},{"id":"067996AD1EAD61000183130323834353034","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"不准跟过来——算了……那就跟好了别掉队！","hasText":true,"duration":7.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/067996AD1EAD61000183130323834353034.mp3"},{"id":"062976AD1EAD51000183135373333323735","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"一只猞猁再厉害，也比不过一群猞猁。这话搁在以前我是不信的","hasText":true,"duration":7.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/062976AD1EAD51000183135373333323735.mp3"},{"id":"060166AD1EAD71000183137343639383738","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"这就是你们说的“甜”？没尝出什么味儿，反倒……把牙齿黏住了！","hasText":true,"duration":8.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/060166AD1EAD71000183137343639383738.mp3"},{"id":"067396AD1EAD61000183237303634343037","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"老族长说耳簇毛越长，猞猁就越聪明……你看我这两簇怎么样？","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/067396AD1EAD61000183237303634343037.mp3"},{"id":"060536AD1EAD51000183639383635333839","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"击杀语音","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"今晚加餐！","hasText":true,"duration":2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/060536AD1EAD51000183639383635333839.mp3"},{"id":"064646AD1EAD41000183133303036373938","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"大厅展示1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"我们的跃动，就是山野的心跳！","hasText":true,"duration":14.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/064646AD1EAD41000183133303036373938.mp3"},{"id":"063906AD1EAD51000183133373832343434","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"个性动作语音1","category":"动作","seq":null,"text":"你也困了？那就一起休息下吧！","hasText":true,"duration":9.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/063906AD1EAD51000183133373832343434.mp3"},{"id":"069906AD1EAD51000183138303837343737","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"死亡语音","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"哼！等我吃饱了再来！","hasText":true,"duration":3.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/069906AD1EAD51000183138303837343737.mp3"},{"id":"069396AD1EAD41000183930363337373839","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"大厅展示2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"真正的猎手，从不依靠运气，而是依靠——绝对的武力！","hasText":true,"duration":14.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/069396AD1EAD41000183930363337373839.mp3"},{"id":"067436AD1EAD41000183131383437363638","heroId":"1649","skinId":"1796","skinName":"猞我其谁","title":"大厅展示3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"雾之森的规矩？干就完了！","hasText":true,"duration":14,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1649/067436AD1EAD41000183131383437363638.mp3"}]